## Comparative Analysis

**Paper summary:** A two-stage LLM safety alignment method: (1) CoT Safety SFT to induce reasoning-before-refusal, and (2) Alignment-Weighted DPO (AW-DPO), which assigns differential optimization weights to reasoning-trace vs. response segments based on harmfulness scores. Evaluated on SorryBench (20 attack types, 4 model families).

